{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24062","headline":"咏怀 · 白居易","name":"咏怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高人乐丘园，中人慕官职。\n一事尚难成，两途安可得。\n遑遑干世者，多苦时命塞。\n亦有爱闲人，又爲穷饿逼。\n我今幸双遂，禄仕兼游息。\n未尝羡荣华，不省劳心力。\n妻孥与婢仆，亦免愁衣食。\n所以吾一家，面无忧喜色。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}